  m_text: "=========================\n<b>- Contributer @ LA - </b>\n\nHello bois, my name is MXME\n\nHere is what I do,\n\nMost of the jumpscares and monsters are made by me\n\n- I made 1 or 2 bundles and i come up with alot of ideas\n\n- If you see me ingame im usually sleeping ingame as its very funny!!!\n\n============[EXTRA]=============\n\n- ! FUN FACT !    I made like 80% of the monsters in this game same with jumpscares :) "
